  "raw_label": "postponed_or_procedural",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Minor N Thr Mother P vs State Of Nct Of Delhi And Anr on 4 September, 2024 Author: Anoop Kumar Mendiratta Bench: Anoop Kumar Mendiratta $~69 * In The High Court Of Delhi At New Delhi + W.P.(Crl) 2728/2024 Minor N Thr Mother P Th ve State Of Nct Of Delhi And Anr. ... Through: Mr. Yasir Rauf Ansari, Alok Sharma and Mr. V Advs. Coram: HON'BLE MR. JUSTICE ANOOP KUMAR MENDIRATTA ORDER % 04.09.2024 Exemption allowed, subject to just exceptions.",
    "facts": "FIR No. 351/2024 under Section 376 IPC and Section 4 of POCSO Act was registered at P.S.: Jaitpur on statement of victim on 28.08.2024, when the pregnancy came to notice, though victim is alleged to have been sexually assaulted in March, 2024. 5. By way of present petition, petitioner/victim through her mother requests for termination of pregnancy since the same is beyond permissible limit of medical termination under Medical Termination of Pregnancy Act, 1971, as amended in 2021 (hereinafter referred to as \"MTP Act\"). The authenticity of the order can be re-verified from Delhi High Court Order Portal by scanning the QR code shown above.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
